1
00:00:00,435 --> 00:00:03,495
(Sheldon:)I trust you paid off
those parking tickets.

2
00:00:03,871 --> 00:00:04,891
(Ms Jenson:)Yes, I did.

3
00:00:05,073 --> 00:00:08,063
(Sheldon:)Hearing unimpaired. Good.

4
00:00:08,276 --> 00:00:10,676
(Ms Jenson:)Look, Dr. Cooper,
I really want this position.

5
00:00:10,845 --> 00:00:14,335
It would be an incredible honor
to work for a man of your brilliance.

6
00:00:14,782 --> 00:00:18,112
(Sheldon:)Flattery will not get you this job,
Ms. Jensen.

7
00:00:18,286 --> 00:00:20,546
(Ms Jenson:)It's not flattery if it's the truth.

8
00:00:20,755 --> 00:00:22,485
(Howard:)Oh.

9
00:00:22,657 --> 00:00:24,177
(Sheldon:)Well, thank you. Welcome aboard.

10
00:00:26,527 --> 00:00:29,117
- Talked to Howard, lately?
- Yeah, last night.

11
00:00:29,297 --> 00:00:32,667
(Raj:)He kept making me drop pencils
for him.

12
00:00:34,068 --> 00:00:36,228
(Raj:)I got uncomfortable.

13
00:00:37,372 --> 00:00:39,532
(Raj:)Hope you're hungry.
They're serving macaroni and...

14
00:00:39,707 --> 00:00:41,797
...cheese.

15
00:00:45,179 --> 00:00:46,979
(Leonard:)Smooth.

16
00:00:49,283 --> 00:00:50,753
(Penny:)- Hi.
- Hello.

17
00:00:50,918 --> 00:00:52,618
Aren't you gonna introduce us?

18
00:00:52,787 --> 00:00:56,227
(Sheldon:)No. I have people for that now.
You're up.

19
00:00:56,424 --> 00:00:58,454
(Ms Jenson:)I'm Alex, Dr. Cooper's new assistant.

20
00:00:58,626 --> 00:01:02,226
(Leonard:)Ah, congratulations,
and may God have mercy on your soul.

